<name>Battery Current Sensor Assembly (2GR-FE)</name>
<para id="RM0000020XN009X" category="G" type-id="3001K" name-id="1712Y-00" from="200708">
<name>Component Inspection</name>
<subpara id="RM0000020XN009X_01" type-id="01" category="01">
<s-1 id="RM0000020XN009X_01_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___0000HCR00000">
<ptxt>Inspect Battery Current Sensor Assembly</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Battery Current Sensor</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A105340J24" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<s3>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), inspect the resistance between each terminal.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title/>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection Tester positive - Tester negative</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>2(VC5) - 4(E2)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>3 to 10 KΩ</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>2(VC5) - 3(IB)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>0.5 kΩ or less</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>3(IB) - 4(E2)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>3 to 10 KΩ</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</s3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Resistance Inspection (Battery Thermometer Sensor)</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), inspect the resistance between terminals 1 (Temp) - 4 (GND).</ptxt>
<spec>
<title/>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>1(THB) - 4(GND)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>25°C</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>1.9 to 2.1KΩ</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten3>
<ptxt>The standard temperature represents the temperature around the sensor area, not the temperature of the sensor itself.</ptxt>
</atten3>
</s3>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
</subpara>
</para>
